  "releaseNotes": "2.0.1 Added separate path for Stored Procedures and DB Context.\n2.0.0 Added Mutations Create, UpdateById, Update, DeleteById and Delete along with MutationInputTypes, CreateEntityInputType and UpdateEntityInputType. CreateInputType will have required fields as Non-Nullable while UpdateInputType will have all fields nullable.\nAdded Mutation fields for Stored Procedures.\nAlso, removed type: typeof(DateTimeGraphType) as its no longer needed and in GraphQL 9.x type will be removed from FieldBuilder.",
